    <title>Docling Technical Report</title>
    <updated>2024-12-09T09:20:54Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.09869v5" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2408.09869v5" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>This technical report introduces Docling, an easy to use, self-contained, MIT-licensed open-source package for PDF document conversion. It is powered by state-of-the-art specialized AI models for layout analysis (DocLayNet) and table structure recognition (TableFormer), and runs efficiently on commodity hardware in a small resource budget. The code interface allows for easy extensibility and addition of new features and models.</summary>
